; ColecoVision port names for the Disassembler window, in Emulicious' .ports
; format: <hex port> <name> [in|out]; without a direction the name serves
; both. A file of the same name in a project's folder takes its place.
; The Super Game Module's ports are here too: without the module they are
; simply never used.

80 Port_KeypadSelect out
C0 Port_JoystickSelect out
FC Port_Controller1 in
FF Port_Controller2 in
FF Port_PSG out

BE Port_VDPData
BF Port_VDPAddress out
BF Port_VDPStatus in

50 Port_AYAddress out
51 Port_AYData out
52 Port_AYRead in
53 Port_SGMUpper out
7F Port_SGMLower out
